
@_4VGymEF_HostAddress = http://localhost:5117

### GET - Todos los tipos de actividad
GET {{_4VGymEF_HostAddress}}/activity-types
Accept: application/json

### GET - Instructor existente (Markel López)
GET {{_4VGymEF_HostAddress}}/instructors/2
Accept: application/json

### GET - Instructor inexistente
GET {{_4VGymEF_HostAddress}}/instructors/999
Accept: application/json

### GET - Instructores por inicial A (Ana García y Ander Ruiz)
GET {{_4VGymEF_HostAddress}}/instructors?first_initial=a
Accept: application/json

### GET - Inicial sin resultados
GET {{_4VGymEF_HostAddress}}/instructors?first_initial=z
Accept: application/json


